WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.023
Mass in grams and kilograms

2
00:00:03.023 --> 00:00:34.458
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Mass in grams and kilograms. Ek kilogram mein 1000 grams hote hain, isliye chhoti cheezon ke liye gram kaam aata hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:34.458 --> 00:01:05.290
Aadha kilogram daal 500 grams hoti hai; do aise packets ek kilogram banate hain. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:39.748
Kitchen ke sealed packets ke label dekho aur unke gram ko kilogram se compare karo. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

5
00:01:39.748 --> 00:02:55.315
Ab practice karo: 2 kilogram mein kitne grams? Thoda rukkar socho. Sahi jawab hai 2000. Baaki options kyun fit nahi hote, yeh bhi apne shabdon mein batao. Ek kilogram mein 1000 grams hote hain, isliye chhoti cheezon ke liye gram kaam aata hai. Aadha kilogram daal 500 grams hoti hai; do aise packets ek kilogram banate hain. Is idea ko yaad rakhne ke liye apni notebook mein ek chhota labelled drawing banao. Jab tum apne shabdon mein samjha paate ho, tab tumne sirf answer nahi yaad kiya, balki uska reason bhi samjha. Aaj ka chhota recap: Ek kilogram mein 1000 grams hote hain, isliye chhoti cheezon ke liye gram kaam aata hai. Agli baar aas-paas ki duniya mein isi idea ka ek aur example dhoondhna.

6
